      "name": "Workspace header",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native title, operation mode, and exception summary; static HTML translation.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-terminal\"><b class=\"ds-brand\">gitsy</b>                         <span class=\"ds-muted\">fetch · done</span>\n<span class=\"ds-muted\">12 repos</span> · <span class=\"ds-danger\">1 failed</span> · <span class=\"ds-warning\">3 changed · 2 behind</span></div>",
